Package: libitb3r
Type: Package
Title: ITB Symmetric Cipher Construction with Ambiguity-Based Security - R
Version: 0.5.1
Authors@R: person("Andrey", "Kuvshinov", email = "andrew@encloud.blue",
    role = c("aut", "cre"))
Description: Thin proxy over the libitb3 shared library's Triple
    Pipeline surface. Exposes Single Message and Streaming
    encrypt/decrypt, state-blob export/open, rekey, incremental
    stream sessions, profile registration, and the Go runtime knobs.
    Every hash-name / MAC-name / cipher-name / profile-name is an
    opaque string passed through to Go for validation; no ITB
    construction logic lives in the binding.
License: Apache License (== 2.0)
URL: https://github.com/everanium/itb
BugReports: https://github.com/everanium/itb/issues
Depends: R (>= 4.0)
Suggests: testthat (>= 3.0.0)
Encoding: UTF-8
LazyData: true
NeedsCompilation: yes
